Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether $\dim_{\mathbb{R}} L^p(X,\mathcal{M},\mu) > 1$ implies the existence of disjoint sets $A, B \in \mathcal{M}$ with $0 < \mu(A), \mu(B) < \infty$.

